A single optional definition, as in the Energy example, is a native disclosure and does not need a grouped accordion.

Test each with a keyboard, with a screen reader, at 320 CSS pixels and at 200% text. Follow the [Civica accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html). Also check long summaries and printing. With scripts off, every section must still be present in a sensible order.
